§§ `מכתב נלווה 2 -- illustrations`

-- The sabbatical budget serves one purpose on any day.
#ASSERT NOT `both the welfare fund and the sabbatical contributions are budgeted on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2014) (JUST (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2013))
#ASSERT `what the sabbatical letter's budget serves on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2014) NOTHING EQUALS `the welfare fund`
